Testing string join method (kudar):

Basic example:
  Names: [Ayaan, Cali, Zahra]
  Joined with comma: Ayaan, Cali, Zahra

Empty list test:
  Empty list joined with dash: ''

Single item list:
  Single item list joined with dots: Warsame

Different separators:
  With comma: Tufaax, Moos, Cambe
  With dash: Tufaax - Moos - Cambe
  With empty string: TufaaxMoosCambe

Newline separator:
  Items on separate lines:
Item 1
Item 2
Item 3

Practical examples:
  CSV line generation: 2023-06-15,Ahmed,Somalia,30
  URL building: https://example.com/api/v1/users/123
  File path construction: home/user/documents/report.pdf
  HTML list generation: Hordhac<li>Faahfaahin<li>Gunaanad</li>
  Sentence construction: Soplang waa luqad cusub oo waxtar leh.

